@OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Register a seller (F1)
POST {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seller1",
  "email": "seller1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Seller"
}

### Register a buyer (F1)
POST {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "buyer1",
  "email": "buyer1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Buyer"
}

### Login
POST {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Get categories (F8)
GET {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/categories

### Search / browse auctions (F8)
GET {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auctions?keyword=phone&page=1&pageSize=20

### Create an auction (F2) — requires Seller Bearer token
POST {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auctions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerAccessToken}}

{
  "title": "Vintage Camera",
  "description": "A well-kept vintage film camera.",
  "imageUrl": null,
  "startingPrice": 50.00,
  "endTime": "2026-08-20T18:00:00Z",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Get auction by id
GET {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auctions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Place a bid (F3) — requires Buyer Bearer token
POST {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerAccessToken}}

{
  "auctionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "amount": 75.00
}

### Bid history (F7)
GET {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/auctions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/bids

### Seller dashboard (F6) — requires Seller Bearer token
GET {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/seller/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerAccessToken}}

### My notifications (F3/F5) — requires Bearer token
GET {{OnlineAuctionSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerAccessToken}}
